on: Creating accessibility metadata for mobile applications from pixels\n\t\t\n\t\t\tXiaoyiZhang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLilianDe Greef\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAmandaSwearngin\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSamuelWhite\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKyleMurray\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLisaYu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tQiShan\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJeffreyNichols\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJasonWu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tChrisFleizach\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tProceedings of the 2021 CHI Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems\n\t\tthe 2021 CHI Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2021","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"Screen recognition: Creating accessibility metadata for mobile applications from pixels","anchors":[{"ref_id":"b72","section_path_id":"1~16","quote":"72]","offset":1549}]},{"raw_text":"HanlinZhu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tBanghuaZhu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJiantaoJiao\n\t\t\n\t\tarXiv:2402.01173\n\t\tEfficient Prompt Caching via Embedding Similarity\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2024. 2024\n\t\t\n\t\n\tarXiv preprint","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2402.01173","title":null,"anchors":[{"ref_id":"b73","section_path_id":"1~13","quote":"[73]","offset":1024}]},{"raw_text":"XizhouZhu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYuntaoChen\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tChenxinHao Tian\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWeijieTao\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tChenyuSu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tGaoYang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tBinHuang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLeweiLi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tXiaogangLu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWang\n\t\t\n\t\tarXiv:2305.17144\n\t\tGhost in the Minecraft: Generally Capable Agents for Open-World Enviroments via Large Language Models with Text-based Knowledge and Memory\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2023. 2023\n\t\t\n\t\n\tarXiv preprint","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2305.17144","title":null,"anchors":[{"ref_id":"b74","section_path_id":"1~14","quote":"74]","offset":434}]}],"layout_json":null,"tei_xml":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<TEI xml:space=\"preserve\" xmlns=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0\" \nxmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" \nxsi:schemaLocation=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0